    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Ｖnonpastまい\n1. 行くまい (〜will not go; probably will not go)\n2. 教えるまい (〜will not teach; probably will not teach)\n\nAdj(i)stemくはあるまい\n1. 高くはあるまい (〜is probably not expensive)\n\nAdj(na)stem/Nounであるまい\n1. 静かではあるまい (〜is probably not quiet)\n2. 先生ではあるまい (〜is probably not a teacher)",
      "html": "Ｖnonpastまい<br/>1. 行くまい (〜will not go; probably will not go)<br/>2. 教えるまい (〜will not teach; probably will not teach)<br/><br/>Adj(i)stemくはあるまい<br/>1. 高くはあるまい (〜is probably not expensive)<br/><br/>Adj(na)stem/Nounであるまい<br/>1. 静かではあるまい (〜is probably not quiet)<br/>2. 先生ではあるまい (〜is probably not a teacher)",
      "credits_raw": "rubyhatchet",
      "content_sha256": "cd2d23afcd660d83f872ed81694882eb077274316a4638c8f8d133b04a8834ea",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "As for the first example, we don't say 死ぬまい for the third person. We'd say 病気で死ぬことはあるまいと思うが、…。\nWhen you talk about yourself, you'd say この病気で死ぬまい、絶対生きてやる。",
      "html": "As for the first example, we don't say 死ぬまい for the third person. We'd say 病気で死ぬことはあるまいと思うが、…。<br/>When you talk about yourself, you'd say この病気で死ぬまい、絶対生きてやる。",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "134e3fc818a9370edd70777592718fcadbbce2b64f24a8e700df7968a09e638e",
